<title>NEW ZEALAND: CRICKET-ENGLAND VS NZ SCOREBOARD ON 4TH DAY.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND VS NZ SCOREBOARD ON 4TH DAY.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the fourth day of</p>
<p>the first cricket test between England and New Zealand at Eden</p>
<p>Park on Monday.</p>
<p>New Zealand first innings 390</p>
<p>England first innings 521 (overnight 366 for six wickets)</p>
<p> N. Knight lbw b Doull		  5  </p>
<p> M. Atherton c and b Patel	   83  </p>
<p> A. Stewart c and b Doull	   173  </p>
<p> N. Hussain c Fleming b Patel	 8  </p>
<p> G. Thorpe hit wkt b Cairns	 119  </p>
<p> J. Crawley run out		    14  </p>
<p> C. White lbw b Vaughan		 0  </p>
<p> D. Cork c Young b Morrison	  59  </p>
<p> D. Gough c Germon b Morrison	 2  </p>
<p> A. Mullally c Germon b Morrison   21  </p>
<p> P. Tufnell not out		    19  </p>
<p> Extras (lb-12, b-2, nb-2, w-2)    18  </p>
<p> Total				    521  </p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-18, 2-200, 3-222, 4-304, 5-339, 6-339,</p>
<p>7-453, 8-471, 9-478, 10-521.</p>
<p>Bowling: Morrison 24.4-4-104-3 (nb-2), Doull 39-10-118-2</p>
<p>(w-1), Cairns 30-3-103-1 (w-1), Astle 14-3-33-0, Vaughan</p>
<p>36-10-57-1, Patel 44-10-92-2.</p>
<p>New Zealand second innings</p>
<p> B. Pocock lbw b Gough		 20</p>
<p> B. Young c Hussain b Cork	    3</p>
<p> A. Parore not out		     16</p>
<p> S. Fleming c Crawley b Tufnell     9</p>
<p> L. Germon not out			4</p>
<p> Extras (nb-4)			    4</p>
<p> Total				     56</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-17, 2-28, 3-47.</p>
<p>Bowling: Cork 7-3-17-1, Mullally 7-4-5-0, White 3-1-6-0</p>
<p>(nb-1), Gough 7-1-16-1 (nb-2), Tufnell 5-1-12-1 (nb-1).</p>
